From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnostic dump of every draw of one frame
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: host diagnostics, off until requested. Apply after 0081.

aurora_debug_request_draw_dump(path) writes the GX state of every draw and
EFB copy between the next two display copies to a text file: blend/depth
state, TEV stages, colour channels with their light, material and ambient
colours, TEV/konst registers, texgens and every sampled texture. For a
texture loaded from RAM it reports whether the bound upload still matches
the current RAM contents and the average decoded colour, so a dark and a
bright run of the same scene can be compared draw by draw.

